{"completed": true, "response": "这时候，之前一会儿开心、一会儿担心的心情，好像暂时都留在了心里。和对方亲近让他感到温暖和安心，他也时不时想再靠近一些，心里突然变得急切，但很快又因为担心两人的关系发生变化而犹豫起来。因为这份亲近已经让他真切地感到满足，所以谨慎虽然暂时压住了他想继续靠近的冲动，却无法消除这份满足和留恋。他就这样停留在一种温柔却又有些放不开的状态里，想靠近的心情时而涌上来，时而又平静下去，但心里始终还牵挂着。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c79f58b5-3c79-4717-89ec-8c8b798b3714", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T004153296045Z", "elapsed_seconds": 6.266, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:41:59.559282+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d875ccece6bc01fcc828b789d84b473238cd1813b45dd0dc34a7978f8a0c212a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T004153296045Z", "files": ["proof-offline.pn